  },
  {
    "id": 10004,
    "uuid": "f6e447a5-30fb-4c81-b27f-11ee6ac390eb",
    "hitokoto": "醒时空为梦一场，事事俱忘，何处是吾乡。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "符华",
    "creator": "莽红尘觅知嘤",
    "creator_uid": 5611,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1593567776",
    "length": 19
  },
  {
    "id": 10005,
    "uuid": "435fc645-1fe2-4d29-a0a6-b62e11b47bd2",
    "hitokoto": "怡然独向九霄中， 坐看浮生作梦。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "崩坏3",
    "creator": "莽红尘觅知嘤",
    "creator_uid": 5611,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1593567797",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 10006,
    "uuid": "3190fd5e-107c-4b28-a9cb-916b02c48f0d",
    "hitokoto": "纵使黑云蔽日，我也要燃烧天空，带你找到回家的路。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "崩坏3",
    "creator": "莽红尘觅知嘤",
    "creator_uid": 5611,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1593567865",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10007,
    "uuid": "5bab2c03-7b3d-436c-b3a8-74842f711836",
    "hitokoto": "去把这个并不完美的世界，变成你所期望的样子。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "姬子",
    "creator": "莉娅碳的骑士",
    "creator_uid": 8310,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1611432033",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 10010,
    "uuid": "58d0b145-d474-4a8e-939d-94470679a762",
    "hitokoto": "我欲以身济天下，只忧碌碌不得安。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "识之律者",
    "creator": "luner_3497",
    "creator_uid": 14181,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1679187469",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 10011,
    "uuid": "cfc51a1c-13d5-4000-a43a-d77970d4ad68",
    "hitokoto": "女王万岁，不绝于耳！",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "米哈游",
    "creator": "myhaooo",
    "creator_uid": 15977,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1696600227",
    "length": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 10014,
    "uuid": "bec1b0c8-c887-466f-80c1-ca74db546d55",
    "hitokoto": "世界虽然不完美，但总有人在为了守护它而燃尽生命。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "符华",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10015,
    "uuid": "a90b5c22-fa23-4346-b9b9-c3f79498e59c",
    "hitokoto": "英雄，并不是无所不能的超人，而是在绝境中也绝不放弃希望的凡人。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "爱莉希雅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 31
  },
  {
    "id": 10020,
    "uuid": "ce23cb34-caaa-4816-bf4c-edd9b99f4664",
    "hitokoto": "世界上的很多事情，往往并不是非黑即白的二选一。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "德丽莎",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 23
  },
  {
    "id": 10021,
    "uuid": "e1dd926f-0300-43a5-b397-9085211cf29f",
    "hitokoto": "唯有历经无尽长夜的跋涉，才能迎来真正破晓的光明。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "苏",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10022,
    "uuid": "72ecc48b-a7c3-48aa-9d3b-6c995f3d79e1",
    "hitokoto": "人类的赞歌是勇气的赞歌，人类的伟大是勇气的伟大。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "凯文",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10024,
    "uuid": "19dd0052-59f6-4184-af42-35e2acd34b49",
    "hitokoto": "世界虽然残酷，但总有值得我们去守护的微光。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "凯文",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 10026,
    "uuid": "a656e3d3-557b-41be-b951-e95215e31b7c",
    "hitokoto": "无论发生什么，都要笑着面对未来，因为未来一定会变得无比美好哦♪",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "爱莉希雅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 31
  },
  {
    "id": 10027,
    "uuid": "f1eeba88-c830-42e6-a5cf-3e17ebd633d6",
    "hitokoto": "真理，从来不是由谁赐予的，而是靠我们自己的双手去追寻的。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "阿波尼亚",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 10029,
    "uuid": "fdf4c846-d558-4694-a2d2-a254c3f5d462",
    "hitokoto": "我们的故事还没有结束，因为我们还在向着明天前行。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "琪亚娜",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10030,
    "uuid": "e4397e17-d240-4a4f-b4d4-0c16772c6880",
    "hitokoto": "心如明镜，方能映照大千世界；身如菩提，方能度化无边苦海。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "苏",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 10173,
    "uuid": "016f76e9-8965-442f-862e-f0a2252a1a37",
    "hitokoto": "但坚强并不代表着所有的事都必须独自承受。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "布洛妮娅",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 10322,
    "uuid": "dfecaf2a-f549-4200-a593-a9a082f1a1e2",
    "hitokoto": "它创造梦幻、编织绮思，为荒芜的心灵播撒希望，用真诚的祝福颂赞美好。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "？？？",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 33
  },
  {
    "id": 10326,
    "uuid": "c030c928-dbd3-461e-a0fc-cd25c78a260f",
    "hitokoto": "「人性的美丽」就是如此脆弱，却又纯洁无瑕的事物。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "陌生女孩",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 10329,
    "uuid": "26796831-203e-4b27-b5b6-a6b6dee0985b",
    "hitokoto": "你不能消灭组成世界的基本元素，因为那是在与整个世界为敌。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "崩坏3",
    "from_who": "莫里亚蒂",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637189",
    "length": 28
  }
]
